  "venue": {
    "prefix": "s30",
    "notes": "Browns home games at Huntington Bank Field (the retail Cleveland Stadium record s30; one end-zone texture set serves both ends). End zones: the white BROWNS wordmark outlined in orange, flanked by the primary helmet logo (both helmets face the wordmark), on brown paint (the paint colour is INFERRED: sources describe only the wordmark and logos). Midfield: the helmet logo with the white facemask (the 2025 return, kept in 2026). Walls: the 2004 cut-out atlas keeps its layout: the 2026 helmet, BROWNS and BEWARE OF THE DAWGS in the Browns letter face, and DAWG POUND and CLEVELAND in place of the retired 2004 dog face and B-football marks; wall pads restyled to the 2026 brown and orange. Fan banner texts are 2026 players and common fan phrases (INFERRED fan content). No 2026 home game yet (first home game week 3); the 2026 preseason week 2 home gallery shows plain brown wall pads.",
    "sources": [
      "https://news.sportslogos.net/2024/08/07/cleveland-browns-once-again-soliciting-fan-input-for-field-design/football/ (white Browns wordmark outlined in orange in both end zones, primary logo flanking it)",
      "https://sports.yahoo.com/article/browns-announce-midfield-logo-change-154157611.html (2025: helmet logo with a white facebar back at midfield)",
